       >>SOURCE FORMAT IS FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. IR.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    01 IR-I PIC 9(4).
LINKAGE SECTION.
    COPY "compiler-state.cpy".
    01 IR-MODE PIC X.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING COMPILER-STATE IR-MODE.
MAIN-IR.
    IF IR-MODE = "O"
        DISPLAY "----- OPTIMIZED INTERMEDIATE CODE -----"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "----- THREE-ADDRESS INTERMEDIATE CODE -----"
    END-IF
    PERFORM VARYING IR-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL IR-I > CS-IR-COUNT
        DISPLAY IR-I " " FUNCTION TRIM(CS-IR-OP(IR-I))
          " " FUNCTION TRIM(CS-IR-ARG1(IR-I))
          " " FUNCTION TRIM(CS-IR-ARG2(IR-I))
          " -> " FUNCTION TRIM(CS-IR-RESULT(IR-I))
    END-PERFORM
    DISPLAY "----- END INTERMEDIATE CODE -----"
    GOBACK.
